OL,16,     GRylan is joined by the brilliant
OL,17,     GIrish singer, songwriter Ronan
OL,18,     GKeating for some fun in KaRYoke.
OL,19,     GPlus, it's all very close in our
OL,20,     Gfilm & TV quiz Couch Potatoes,
OL,21,     Gbut who will win?
